            "description": "# Welcome to pythoncms\n\n\n## Local dev\n\nInstall package\n\n\n```\npython -m pip install -e .\n```\nThen initialise\n\n```\ncd pythoncms\nshopyo initialise\nflask --debug run\n```\n\nfor migrating\n\n```\nflask db migrate\nflask db upgrade\n```\n\nrun\n\n```\nflask --debug run\n```\n\ndashboard\n\nlogin with `admin@domain.com` | `pass`\n```\nhttp://127.0.0.1:5000/dashboard/\n```\n\n## Theme\n\nThemes are located at '/static/themes/'\n\nEach theme must have\n\n```\nindex.html\ncontact.html\npage.html\n```\n\n- info.json\n\n```json\n{\n\t\"author\": \"ARJ\",\n\t\"version\": \"1.0.20000000000003\"\n}\n```\n",
